    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "inlineContent": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Strive to meet the recommended minimum control size for each platform. Consider spacing between controls as important as size. In general, it works well to add about 12 points of padding around elements that include a bezel. Place buttons so their centers are at least 60 points apart, leaving 16 points or more of space between them."
      }
